{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-05-11 09:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES DEBUTS FIRST-EVER BRAND FILM, "ALONE IN TOMBSTONE," BASED ON A WATTPAD SHORT STORY ADAPTED FOR THE SCREEN', 'text': 'AIRLINE EXPANDS SUPPORT OF \'ON THE RISE\' CREATIVES TO INCLUDE WRITERS AND FILMMAKERS WITH THE RELEASE OF A SHORT FILM, FURTHERING ITS DEDICATION TO CELEBRATING NEW VOICES\xa0 DALLAS , MAY 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) PREMIERES\xa0THE SHORT FILM "ALONE IN TOMBSTONE," A FIRST-EVER BRAND FILM FOR THE AIRLINE AND THE FIRST WATTPAD BRAND ORIGINAL. THE FILM, BASED ON A SHORT STORY, WAS WRITTEN BY\xa0WATTPAD AUTHOR\xa0E.A.'}